3. Create `/home/bradleyjerome/projects/skyscanner-app/src/cli.ts` with a `main(argv: string[], env: Record<string,string|undefined>): Promise<number>` function that parses `--from`, `--to`, `--date`, and `--adults` flags using only Node built-ins (no new dependencies), ignores or reports unknown flags without treating them as positional overrides, defaults `--adults` to `1` when omitted, and validates all required flags.

